sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    box 同步调度
        participant SS as SyncScheduler
        participant GW as Worker GPU
    end
    box 异步调度
        participant AS as AsyncScheduler
        participant AW as Worker GPU
    end

    Note over SS,GW: === 同步: step间有隐式同步 ===
    SS->>GW: S0.schedule() 下发执行
    GW-->>SS: S0 执行完成
    SS->>SS: update状态
    SS->>GW: S1.schedule() 基于准确状态
    GW-->>SS: S1 返回
    SS->>SS: update状态

    Note over AS,AW: === 异步: step间无同步,流水化 ===
    AS->>AW: S0.schedule() 下发执行
    AS->>AS: output_placeholders += N (假设!)
    AS->>AW: S1.schedule() 不等S0,基于假设!
    AS->>AS: 继续累加 placeholder
    AW-->>AS: S0 结果返回
    AS->>AS: output_placeholders -= len(tokens) (修正!)
    AS->>AW: S2.schedule()
    AW-->>AS: S1 结果返回
    AS->>AS: 修正 S1 placeholder
    Note over AS,AW: Scheduler 始终领先 Worker 1~2步
